---
interface Props {
  lang?: string;
}

const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="spanish-gateway-section" id="seccion-espanol" aria-label="Atención Legal en Español">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="spanish-gateway-card">
      <div class="card-left-content">
        <div class="spanish-kicker">
          <span class="gold-bullet"></span>
          <span>COMPROMISO CON LA COMUNIDAD HISPANA DE CALIFORNIA</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="spanish-title">
          ¿Necesita ayuda legal en español?
        </h2>

        <div class="gold-divider-left"></div>

        <p class="spanish-lead">
          En Equal Justice Lawyers entendemos que enfrentar una lesión grave, un accidente o un despido injustificado es abrumador. Comunicarse en su propio idioma con abogados que le respetan y escuchan no es un privilegio — es su derecho.
        </p>

        <p class="spanish-body">
          Nuestro equipo cuenta con abogados litigantes y coordinadores de casos 100% bilingües en todo California. Evaluamos su situación sin costo alguno, le explicamos sus derechos bajo las leyes estatales y le representamos con valentía y dedicación absoluta.
        </p>

        <div class="spanish-actions">
          <a href="/es/" class="btn-gold">
            <span>Explorar Sitio en Español</span>
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a href="#chat" class="btn-outline-white chat-trigger-btn" data-trigger-chat>
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Chat Confidencial en Español</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-right-features">
        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feat-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c8a04a" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              <polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-info">
            <h4 class="feat-title">Sin Barreras de Idioma</h4>
            <p class="feat-desc">Atención directa en español sin intérpretes externos que retrasen o compliquen su comunicación.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feat-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c8a04a" stroke-width="1.8">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
              <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-info">
            <h4 class="feat-title">Su Estatus Migratorio No Afecta Sus Derechos</h4>
            <p class="feat-desc">En California, la ley protege a todos los trabajadores y personas lesionadas, sin importar su condición migratoria.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feat-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c8a04a" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-info">
            <h4 class="feat-title">Hablar con Nuestro Equipo Hoy</h4>
            <p class="feat-desc">Inicie su consulta hoy mismo. Recibirá una respuesta ágil, humana y enteramente en español.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .spanish-gateway-section {
    background: var(--color-dark-green-deep);
    padding: 6rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200, 160, 74, 0.2);
    position: relative;
  }

  .spanish-gateway-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26, 51, 40, 0.85) 0%, rgba(18, 32, 25, 0.95) 100%);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(200, 160, 74, 0.35);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 4rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .spanish-gateway-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(200, 160, 74, 0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .spanish-kicker {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .gold-bullet {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--color-gold);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .spanish-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-white);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .spanish-lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .spanish-body {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .spanish-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Right Features Column */
  .card-right-features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .feature-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200, 160, 74, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .feature-box:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    border-color: var(--color-gold);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .feat-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(200, 160, 74, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200, 160, 74, 0.3);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .feat-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .feat-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .feat-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .spanish-gateway-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.75rem;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .spanish-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
